  "generic_website_domains": {
    "comment": "The website counterpart of generic_email_domains: domains shared by many collectivités, which therefore carry none of their names: social networks, site builders, blog platforms, municipal-info apps, commercial directories, the default personal-page hosting of ISPs, and the mutualised platforms of some CDG. A site declared on one of them is treated as no site at all (RPNT criterion 1.1), which also spares it the check_website probes. Matching covers the domain and all its subdomains, so list the narrowest domain that is always shared: \"sites.google.com\", not \"google.com\". Never list a domain a collectivité may own: collectivite.fr is a State service and belongs in WEBSITE_REDIRECT_DOMAINS_ALLOWED (tasks/defs.py), not here.",
